  ('176f9986-1bd6-409d-87fa-c0aa5020bd2b'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000308'::uuid, 'OH', 'medicaid_mco', 'G0181', 'covered', '{"answer":"Not covered by Ohio Medicaid. Appendix DD to rule 5160-1-60, revised 01/01/2026, does not list G0181 (home health care supervision, 30 minutes or more per month) on any of its 8 tabs — of the 9,617 distinct codes the workbook carries, the two either side of it are consecutive (G0138 (Iv cipaglucosidase alfa-atga) followed directly by G0202 (Screening mammography, digital, bilateral, all views)) with no row in between. Absence is decisive here rather than merely unpublished, because the schedule''s blanket exclusion note states that codes in the listed ranges \"are not covered\" unless otherwise indicated, and the first range it lists is G0001-G9999. G0181 falls inside that range and is not otherwise indicated, so Humana Healthy Horizons of Ohio has a state determination to follow and it is a denial. Bill it only if the plan documents its own coverage above the state floor.","source":"Ohio Medicaid Appendix DD to rule 5160-1-60, revised 01/01/2026, read 2026-08-12","rateBasis":null,"stateFfsRate":null}'::jsonb, 'not_covered', 0.85, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'f4d00000-0000-4000-8000-00000000dd08'::uuid, 'Appendix DD to rule 5160-1-60, blanket exclusion note — Unless otherwise indicated, services and items represented by codes in the following ranges are not covered.', 'extract:oh-carecoord-absent-2026-08'),
